{"chapter-slug":"rw8-38 H","paragraph":695,"wording":"[Bandit Lord]","event":"named","claimed":true,"claimed-by-slug":"merr-the-storm","holder-quote":"“No. No! If you weren’t a fellow [Slave] and I didn’t like you, fat man, I’d kick the crap out of you for that. That damned Maresar messed all of us up…she was a [Bandit] way back, before the new generation rolled in. So her class was [Bandit Lord] because there was no leadership! There are plenty of [Bandit Ladies]! Anyways, Maresar used to dress like a man. Everyone thought she was a [Bandit Lord]—word is she can even blend in with others thanks to her Skill. That’s why she got the class. I’m a [Bandit Lady]. Lady.”","id":"2bd025ae-4fcd-57fe-aa22-a5ad4c4eaab8"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-38 H","paragraph":695,"wording":"[Bandit Lord]","event":"named","claimed":true,"claimed-by-slug":"merr-the-storm","holder-quote":"“No. No! If you weren’t a fellow [Slave] and I didn’t like you, fat man, I’d kick the crap out of you for that. That damned Maresar messed all of us up…she was a [Bandit] way back, before the new generation rolled in. So her class was [Bandit Lord] because there was no leadership! There are plenty of [Bandit Ladies]! Anyways, Maresar used to dress like a man. Everyone thought she was a [Bandit Lord]—word is she can even blend in with others thanks to her Skill. That’s why she got the class. I’m a [Bandit Lady]. Lady.”","id":"bb0ccb10-fa2e-50ec-95fd-885c41b3efd2"}
